# (the voices batch, item 3) Choir, the Drone's formant choir, on its page's ALGORITHM: the Drone's sixth voice (after
# Glass: five turns on from Organ; the FM pads after it since item 5, so one turn back now lands on the last of
# them), Horn still its third; said, kept in the project, heard (its vowel moving as Timewind
# plays: the Drone's Move page), and kept over a restart
wait 300
listen
tap ENV
wait 300
turn ALGO 5
wait 300
said VOICE Choir
expect par22 5
turn ALGO -5
wait 300
said VOICE Organ
expect par22 0
spin ALGO 2
wait 300
said VOICE Horn
expect par22 2
spin ALGO 3
wait 300
said VOICE Choir
expect par22 5
wait 8000
expect chwork >0
# kept: stopped, it saves itself; the same after a restart (the save's format as it was: 8; Choir appended, nothing
# moved)
tap PLAY
wait 6000
expect dirty 0
expect store_writes >0
reboot
wait 500
expect format 8
expect par22 5
